{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AtomicMass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AtomicMass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:QOU.AtomicMass.MagicNumbersFromQ"],"declarations":25,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.elements","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.elements","kind":"def","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L189-L310","doc":"The 118 tabulated elements with their AME2020 binding energies. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.oganesson","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.oganesson","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L162-L163","doc":"Oganesson-294 (Z=118, N=176): heaviest tabulated element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.iron56","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.iron56","kind":"def","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L160-L161","doc":"Iron-56 (Z=26, N=30): peak binding energy per nucleon. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.hydrogen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.hydrogen","kind":"def","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L158-L159","doc":"Hydrogen (Z=1, N=0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.deviation_uniform","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.deviation_uniform","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L138-L154","doc":"**Uniform per-element deviation bound.**  For any element datum,\n`|codataMass − ameMass| ≤ Z·|offset_Z| + N·|offset_N|`.  This\nsingle generic statement subsumes the per-element numerical checks\n(the offsets are bounded by `codata_ame_offset_per_{Z,N}_bound`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_N_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_N_bound","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L133-L136","doc":"The per-neutron offset is below 2 × 10⁻⁶ MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_Z_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_Z_bound","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L128-L131","doc":"The per-proton offset is below 2 × 10⁻⁵ MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.codata_minus_ame_offset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.codata_minus_ame_offset","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L116-L126","doc":"**Structural identity.**  For any element datum the CODATA−AME2020\nmass difference is `Z·offset_Z + N·offset_N`.  The `A·(B/A)`\nbinding terms cancel; the proton and neutron offsets do not. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_N","kind":"def","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L109-L114","doc":"Per-neutron CODATA−AME2020 offset: `m_n − (u + Δ_n)`\n≈ 1.46 × 10⁻⁶ MeV (residual CODATA-2022 vs AME2020 neutron-mass\ndiscrepancy).  Nonzero — this is the term the historical\n`= Z·offset_Z` lemma wrongly dropped. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.codata_ame_offset_per_Z","kind":"def","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L104-L107","doc":"Per-proton CODATA−AME2020 offset: `(m_p + m_e) − (u + Δ_H)`\n≈ 1.546 × 10⁻⁵ MeV (H-atom electron binding energy). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.ameMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.ameMass","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L98-L100","doc":"AME2020-derived atomic mass for an element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.codataMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.codataMass","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L94-L96","doc":"CODATA-derived atomic mass for an element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.BperA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.BperA","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L92-L92","doc":"Binding energy per nucleon from AME2020 (MeV). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.N","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L90-L90","doc":"Neutron number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.Z","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L88-L88","doc":"Atomic number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L86-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ElementDatum","kind":"structure","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L85-L92","doc":"Element data: atomic number, neutron number, AME2020 B/A (MeV). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.ame2020_atomic_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.ame2020_atomic_mass","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L80-L83","doc":"AME2020 path: `M = A·u + Z·Δ_H + N·Δ_n − A·(B/A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AtomicMass.codata_atomic_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AtomicMass.codata_atomic_mass","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AtomicMass.lean#L75-L78","do